{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔了一天休息，终于来到公布考试结果的日子。", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一早就去看公布栏上张贴的成绩排名，不过……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊～啊啊啊～啊……啊……”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0226", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "进教室前我听见奇妙的声音。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我该打开这扇门吗？还是离开比较好……", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～欸～哇～真的假的～啊啊啊还可以吧……啊～”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0227", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～安洁也好幸福～能让你喜欢安洁好开心～～”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0718", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，开吧。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一进教室，我看到安洁在帮大家按摩肩膀。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学成为第一个试验品，她从刚才开始就发出舒服的呻吟声。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到她这个模样，考试结果什么的，好像都不重要了。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那接下来是樱乃学妹～”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0719", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……嗯、嗯、安洁、太用力了、嗯。”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0680", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐也请坐请坐。”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0720", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……嗯呼、嗯、小菜夏真厉害……”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mu0325", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最后压轴当然是爱理同学也要～”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0721", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、啊、那里不行……嗯唔……再温柔、嗯嗯、一点啦、嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ar3749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、嗯、嗯、啊啊、那里……那里、好棒……啊啊……嗯……嗯……”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ar3750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只有爱理按这么久？”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0228", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为爱理同学是年级第一名呀～”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0722", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，原来有关连……”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，在濑名同学家的用功发挥了效果，全员都考到比预期中更好的成绩。", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学还是不变的年级第一名。安洁的肩膀按摩似乎就是奖励的样子。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这次就只有帮女生们按摩，请男生们多多包涵喔～”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0723", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯我不用啦……”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然在旁边看到有点心跳加速……", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太，你看完考试结果后跑到哪里去了？结果我一个人独占这个场面了喔……", "text_idx": 503, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不提我内心的骚动，安洁继续按摩着肩膀。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学，按摩按摩按摩～”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0724", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊啊啊……！”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ar3751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理好像很舒服……”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0681", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为最近肩膀很僵硬……啊啊啊……有、有认真念书太好了……！”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ar3752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～噜～”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "pn0098", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？小熊喵也想被按摩吗？”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mu0326", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我来按吧♪”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mu0327", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜、噜～呜噜呜呜～”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "pn0099", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这里吗？这里舒服吧～”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0725", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊那里……嗯嗯……嗯嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ar3753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜……呜噜呜呜……”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "pn0100", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "神秘的合奏开始了，我觉得自己真的把考试结果都忘光了。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈嘿……♪”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ar3754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔喔喔，爱理升天了呢……”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0229", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃觉得怎么样？”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……感觉肩膀变轻了。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0682", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在的话好像１００米可以跑出１０秒内。”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0683", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那跟肩膀轻不轻没有关系吧。”", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，安洁的女仆按摩好像大受好评呢！”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0726", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有一部分人评价太好，魂都飞了……”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我第一次看到这么软趴趴的濑名同学……", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过安洁也辛苦了。按摩这么多人很累吧？”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会，这点小事没什么，反而希望大家让安洁多按一下呢！”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0727", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，那安洁也帮我按吧～”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ja0055", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也要我也要！”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": "sb0047", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好～那就下一节下课时间来按吧！”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0728", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到那样的反应大家都坐不住了，安洁的按摩立刻就排满了预约。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其说女仆其实更像按摩店了呢……”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，小菜夏很厉害的，没问题喔。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mu0328", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是为什么要突然按摩呢？还变成了按摩女仆。”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mu0329", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到天羽学姐的疑问，安洁开心雀跃地笑了。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为安洁先前被新吾同学的手指技巧弄得酥酥软软了！”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0729", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这句爆炸性发言让整个教室一口气哄然骚动。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接下来……”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0684", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，樱乃。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，当我想着接下来要做什么时候，在走廊上遇到了樱乃。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天也辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事吗？”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0685", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？什么？”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被哥哥的手指技巧弄得酥酥软软那句话。”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0686", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……那个喔。”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那句爆炸性发言后钟声就响了，所以樱乃和天羽学姐都赶紧回去各自的教室……", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁的确是变得酥酥软软呢……”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什什什什么……！？”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0230", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀真是的～别说了啦新吾同学……”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0730", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“混帐瓜生～～！你！你对安洁伸出了魔爪吗～！？”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0231", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“下次肩膀再僵硬的话我还会帮你按摩的，安洁。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿嘿，谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0731", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……咦……肩膀？”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0232", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，之前我稍微帮安洁按摩了一下肩膀。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为被按摩的感觉很好，所以安洁今天才会想帮大家按摩。”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0732", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“然、后、啊……呵呵呵～小纱同学你真是的♪”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0733", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔咿咿……”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0233", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要说那种容易让人误会的话啦，安洁！可恶，你干脆被瓜生那种混帐出手算了！”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "sn0234", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……其实冷静一想，“我按摩安洁肩膀”这件事本身就很那个了。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过多亏了我故意搞笑，这部分就被忽视了。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟在这种环境生活了一个月，我也熟悉应付这种场合的方法了啊……”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真可怕。”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0687", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们兄妹两人连连点头感叹。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟樱乃走向校舍的大门。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁的肩膀，是星期日？”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0688", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，因为安洁果然在努力工作。”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁是因为被我按摩后很高兴，所以才会也想帮大家按摩的吧。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为起因的我，内心有点不好意思。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔……”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0689", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……回去后也帮樱乃按摩肩膀吧？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉不这么说的话好像很尴尬，所以我尽可能让自己自然而然地问。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，是我想按。”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0690", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃果然立刻就点头了。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我喜欢葛格的按摩。安洁会酥酥软软也不是没有道理。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0691", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过那个安洁也让大家都酥酥软软了……”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁跟葛格不一样。回家后也让我酥酥软软吧。”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0692", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好好。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还好现在附近只有我们两人，她这句话似乎比安洁的爆炸性发言更会引发轩然大波。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就快点回家吧。”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0693", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，直接回家吧。”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“用跑的回家。”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0694", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，那样到家前就没体力了……”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“？”", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0695", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“地上有垃圾。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被揉成一团的纸张掉在地上，我捡了起来。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊！？”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0734", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "转头看向声音来源，走廊的另一头出现安洁的身影。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她提着裙摆跑过来。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被抢先了～安洁明明跟两位同一时间注意到垃圾的说～”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0735", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你想捡吗？”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0696", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然了，安洁要捡一大堆垃圾。校园内的整洁是安洁的骄傲喔！”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0736", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定是这份骄傲维持着校内的环境美化吧。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为结女的校园中，即使是班级扫地区域以外的地方也这么干净。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是这次却被新吾同学抢先了。啊哈哈，安洁太丢脸了呢。”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0737", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～那……”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“传球！”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我喊了一声把垃圾抛了出去。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“汪汪！”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0738", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁的裙摆飘起，华丽地接住了。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“然后立刻奔回本垒！”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0739", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好球！”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不可以拿垃圾来玩啦～”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0740", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，彼此彼此。那就麻烦你拿去垃圾桶丢了。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“遵命！欸嘿嘿，那两位请慢走喔～”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0741", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后还是收下了我捡起的垃圾，安洁可爱地行礼后离开了。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我们也走吧，当然是用走的不要跑。”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0697", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“？”", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃歪着头，一直盯着我看。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真稀奇。”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0698", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁？”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0699", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是因为刚才安洁在，所以“葛格”变成“哥哥”了。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然会像那样跟女孩子玩闹。”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0700", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……是吗？我觉得是很普通的玩笑啊。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有像那样。”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0701", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“特别是对结女的女孩子。”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0702", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，的确……", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管与一开始相比相处的气氛变好许多，但对濑名同学、天羽学姐、乾同学就没办法像那样玩闹。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为是安洁嘛。”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结论就是这样。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为她是这样的女孩。安洁在结女的女孩中是最让人容易亲近的。”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0703", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格。”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0704", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“回家后按摩我的肩膀。”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0705", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，好好好，走吧。”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "sk0706", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
